  "historyNote": "#2349, eff 4-28-83; ss by #3193, eff 1-28-86; ss by #5317, EMERGENCY, eff 1-29-92, EXPIRED: 5-28-92 New. #5512, eff 11-25-92; ss by #6895, INTERIM, eff 11-26-98, EXPIRED: 3-26-99 New. #9655, eff 2-13-10, EXPIRED: 2-13-18 New. #12674, INTERIM, eff 11-19-18, EXPIRED: 5-20-19 New. #12795, eff 5-30-19; ss by #13987, eff 5-30-24 (formerly He-P 806.09)",
